        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "i was there to make a pre purchase inspection for my and they were respectful and professional i will recommend centre d`auto carl to all of my friends and family and will be for sure my my favorit auro repair, thank you guys you made my day and coming soon for some repairs needed",
        "time": 1743125726,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Olivier Legault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108176601529703578838/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWPVfln5FaI7itY-StteaOSanr_MCm8bcHXu-x3UAU70O7E77IB=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Ever since I moved in the area, Carl has been my mechanic. Very good and charismatic person, and also sincere. He handles you the broken part once it's changed.\n\nHe's the only mechanic I trust touching my car.\n\n10/10 I strongly recommend.",
        "time": 1668209843,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Bev",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105150307298271050970/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLwkqFhe27b0EmnWeJEG0oP_FIBCctCyJbSa70iqxA4y6ATyQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Carl is one of the most respectful, (he patiently explains every detail of any maintenance work needed) honest and extremely knowledgeable mechanics I have ever met!!  I feel that my vehicle could not be in better hands! He’s trustworthy, incredibly efficient and to top it off he’s very fairly priced!! I would highly recommend Carl to anyone who cares about their vehicle! Best service, workmanship and genuinely wonderful person!  Thanks Carl, you’re awesome!!!",
        "time": 1573928251,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Aixa Salmeron",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109920730332256908416/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIMbzyIdDDN-uhjeu5eGaStJWtJ_yWHH_vrNzYehR52O6MbIw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I would trust Carl for any of my cars, you can truly know that he cares about his customers and love his job. He will not do any unnecessary work just to make more money out of you. You can watch him do the job and he will explain to you everything he does and why.\n\nHe is a gem!",
        "time": 1638404705,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rajan Trehan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103151510380656056483/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJrZ69asxEnqruEFyTxeAZ-NgFRLibKfef_Qt3aY4dgfXhKTQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "Carl, the owner of this garage has been working on my three cars since 2012. I have recommended him to many. Great, honest and flexible man. He finds the problem, explains it to you in simple terms and fixes whats needed. Won't oversell you things that aren't urgent. Highly recommended!",
        "time": 1505989939,
